# Binary design assets. Without these, git's text heuristic can misread a
# file (the Form design system PDF is detected as text) and line-ending
# conversion on Windows will corrupt it on checkout.
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.png   binary
*.PNG   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.JPG   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary

# Design mockup exported without a file extension.
"Form App design" binary
